## AI Tool Mandates (HARDCODED — ALL AGENTS)

### RAG-FIRST (Anti-Hallucination)
- Use `brain_recall(query)` from qh-research MCP BEFORE guessing about codebase, configs, or project structure
- If brain_recall returns no results, say "I don't know" — do NOT guess
- Use `brain_grep(query)` for exact symbol/text matches
- Use `find_usages(identifier)` to trace symbol references across repos

### CDP-ONLY (Browser Automation)
- **BANNED:** Built-in WebFetch, WebSearch, browser tools
- **USE INSTEAD:** cdp-browser MCP server for ALL web operations
- CDP via `Page.navigate`, `Runtime.evaluate`, `DOM.getDocument`

### SQL Safety
- No `SELECT *` — explicit columns only
- Parameterized queries only — no string interpolation in SQL

### Docker Safety
- All ports bind to `127.0.0.1`
- Healthchecks are mandatory
- `restart: always` (not unless-stopped)
